    "text": "The unbalanced chemical reactions given in List I show missing reagent or condition (?) which are provided in list II. match List I with List II and select the correct answer using the code given below the lists :<br />&nbsp;<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>List I</td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>List II</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;A.&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mtext>PbO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><msub><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mtext>SO</mtext><mn>4</mn></msub><mover><mo>&#10230;</mo><mtext>?</mtext></mover><msub><mtext>PbSO</mtext><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mtext>O</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mtext>other product</mtext></math></td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;P&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>NO</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;B.&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mtext>Na</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mtext>O</mtext><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><msub><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>2</mn></msub><mtext>O</mtext><mover><mo>&#10230;</mo><mtext>?</mtext></mover><msub><mtext>NaHSO</mtext><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mtext>other product</mtext></math></td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;Q&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;C.&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><msub><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>4</mn></msub><mover><mo>&#10230;</mo><mtext>?</mtext></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mtext>other product</mtext></math></td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;R&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>Warm</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;D.&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>Xe</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><msub><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>2</mn></msub><mover><mo>&#10230;</mo><mtext>?</mtext></mover><mtext>Xe</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>other product</mtext></math></td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;S</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Cl</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table>",
